{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Eternal Halls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eternal Halls is a fast\u2011paced maze runner where you race through shifting dungeons, collect coins, and escape an invincible Minotaur before it catches you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from five difficulty levels \u2014 Easy, Medium, Hard, Extreme, and Nightmare \u2014 each expanding the size and complexity of the labyrinth. Bigger mazes mean more coins\u2026 and more ways for the Minotaur to trap you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Elemental Abilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use powerful abilities to control the chase:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \tLightning Ball \u2013 slows the Minotaur</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \tMagma Wall \u2013 blocks its path</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \tIce Block \u2013 freezes it in place</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a score attack: grab coins, dodge danger, and reach the exit as fast as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Dungeon Modifiers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match eight optional modifiers to create your own challenge:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \tDark Mode \u2013 navigate with only a flashlight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \tUnderwater Mode \u2013 run through a flooded maze</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \tPoison Mode \u2013 take damage every 7 seconds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \tTimer Mode \u2013 beat the clock or die</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \tIce Mode \u2013 slippery floors change movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \tLava Mode \u2013 stop moving and take damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \tRed Light Mode \u2013 freeze on red or take damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \tThunderstorm Mode \u2013 random lightning strikes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Progression &amp; Unlocks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up from 1 to 99 to unlock Minotaur skins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn decorative items that gradually fill your base as rewards for successful runs.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Pocket Change","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3497420/dbdeb8ddb9723dc130fa9ed3ac6b76e453371b0e.jpg"},{"name":"Lunch Money","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3497420/c7305771aac8059055eade78a1625475363fb201.jpg"},{"name":"Piggy Bank Investor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3497420/100c5f55297e59ea733cf7216df499c1a774f7ed.jpg"},{"name":"Chump Change No More","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3497420/1f187cd140644211d5b93097be54a95848ac9166.jpg"},{"name":"Cash Flowing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3497420/a6d54398468ba663aa737ae676db06caa5ebda14.jpg"},{"name":"Small Loan of a Million Cents","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3497420/35d31d7bffd8aa135c26c8ff7bb5c91aaf1ea013.jpg"},{"name":"Filthy Rich","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3497420/db44ad6c2256e2ef71a73d4de96530d91a29e9ad.jpg"},{"name":"\ud83d\udd25 \"Entering the Labyrinth\" lvl-10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3497420/623aa9ce288b404803956deb160fbeb60e92abc1.jpg"},{"name":"\ud83c\udff9 \"Hunter or Prey?\" lvl-20","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3497420/62bae0f46f8cf5516d61994aa3e00da166d40fe8.jpg"},{"name":"\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f \"Secrets of Knossos\" lvl-30","path":"https: