</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a score attack: grab coins, dodge danger, and reach the exit as fast as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Dungeon Modifiers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match eight optional modifiers to create your own challenge:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \tDark Mode \u2013 navigate with only a flashlight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \tUnderwater Mode \u2013 run through a flooded maze</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \tPoison Mode \u2013 take damage every 7 seconds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \tTimer Mode \u2013 beat the clock or die</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \tIce Mode \u2013 slippery floors change movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \tLava Mode \u2013 stop moving and take damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \tRed Light Mode \u2013 freeze on red or take damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \tThunderstorm Mode \u2013 random lightning strikes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Progression &amp; Unlocks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up from 1 to 99 to unlock Minotaur skins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn decorative items that gradually fill your base as rewards for successful runs.</p>","developers":["Tyler Zade"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497420/header.jpg?t=1771085900","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul clas